[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known: one parser bug, one fix queued. Its reports say
otherwise. The desk merged them on subject line alone ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)),
so three problems with different fixes sit in one ticket. The parser fix alone will not close the
other two.

<Callout kind="warn">
